📦 E-Commerce Logistics Performance Analysis

📌 Project Overview

E-Commerce Logistics Performance Analysis is a data analytics project that analyzes supply chain and shipping data to understand delivery performance, shipping delays, shipping modes, and regional logistics performance.

The project uses Python for data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, KPI calculation, and data visualization. An interactive dashboard is developed using Streamlit to present insights in a user-friendly way.

The goal is to identify delivery performance patterns, understand factors contributing to delays, and support data-driven decision-making.

---

🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyze overall e-commerce shipping performance.
- Calculate on-time and delayed delivery percentages.
- Identify shipping modes with higher delivery durations.
- Analyze monthly shipping trends.
- Compare weekday and weekend shipping performance.
- Analyze delivery delays across different regions and states.
- Identify patterns in late delivery risk.
- Develop an interactive dashboard for logistics performance analysis.

---

